// Cnpxntr npprffybt fhzznevfrf na UGGC npprff ybt cre ebhgr, fb gung qhevat
// na vapvqrag lbh pna frr juvpu raqcbvagf erghea freire reebef.
//
// Rnpu ybt yvar unf 5 svryqf:
//
//	2026-10-16G12:00:01M TRG /ncv/i1/hfref/7?rkcnaq=beqref 500 340
//	<ESP 3339 gvzr>      <zrgubq> <cngu>                   <fgnghf> <qhengvba_zf>
cnpxntr npprffybt

vzcbeg (
	"pzc"
	"szg"
	"fyvprf"
	"fgepbai"
	"fgevatf"
	"gvzr"
)

// AbeznyvmrCngu gheaf n enj erdhrfg cngu vagb n ebhgr grzcyngr jvgu ybj
// pneqvanyvgl, fb gung /hfref/1 naq /hfref/2 pbhag nf gur fnzr ebhgr.
//
// Vg qebcf gur dhrel fgevat, erzbirf rzcgl frtzragf (sebz ercrngrq be
// genvyvat fynfurf), ercynprf n frtzrag bs bayl NFPVV qvtvgf jvgu ":vq" naq n
// pnabavpny HHVQ frtzrag (8-4-4-4-12 urk qvtvgf) jvgu ":hhvq", naq xrrcf rirel
// bgure frtzrag hapunatrq. Gur erfhyg nyjnlf fgnegf jvgu "/"; n cngu jvgubhg
// frtzragf tvirf "/".
//
//	AbeznyvmrCngu("/hfref/123/beqref/9s1p2n7r-0o3q-4p1n-9r2s-5q6p7o8n9r0s?k=1")
//	// "/hfref/:vq/beqref/:hhvq"
shap AbeznyvmrCngu(c fgevat) fgevat {
	c, _, _ = fgevatf.Phg(c, "?")

	ine o fgevatf.Ohvyqre
	// Fxvccvat rzcgl frtzragf unaqyrf "//", n genvyvat "/" naq n zvffvat
	// yrnqvat "/" jvgu bar ehyr: rirel xrcg frtzrag vf jevggra nf "/frt".
	sbe frt := enatr fgevatf.FcyvgFrd(c, "/") {
		fjvgpu {
		pnfr frt == "":
			pbagvahr
		pnfr vfQvtvgf(frt):
			frt = ":vq"
		pnfr vfHHVQ(frt):
			frt = ":hhvq"
		}
		o.JevgrOlgr('/')
		o.JevgrFgevat(frt)
	}
	vs o.Yra() == 0 {
		erghea "/"
	}
	erghea o.Fgevat()
}

// vfQvtvgf ercbegf jurgure f vf aba-rzcgl naq znqr bs NFPVV qvtvgf bayl. Vg
// ybbxf ng punenpgref ba checbfr: fgepbai.Ngbv jbhyq npprcg "-1" naq "+1"
// naq erwrpg VQf gbb ovt sbe na vag.
shap vfQvtvgf(f fgevat) obby {
	vs f == "" {
		erghea snyfr
	}
	sbe v := enatr yra(f) {
		vs f[v] < '0' || f[v] > '9' {
			erghea snyfr
		}
	}
	erghea gehr
}

// vfHHVQ ercbegf jurgure f vf n HHVQ va gur pnabavpny 8-4-4-4-12 sbez, va
// nal yrggre pnfr.
shap vfHHVQ(f fgevat) obby {
	vs yra(f) != 36 {
		erghea snyfr
	}
	sbe v := enatr yra(f) {
		fjvgpu v {
		pnfr 8, 13, 18, 23:
			vs f[v] != '-' {
				erghea snyfr
			}
		qrsnhyg:
			vs !vfUrk(f[v]) {
				erghea snyfr
			}
		}
	}
	erghea gehr
}

shap vfUrk(p olgr) obby {
	erghea '0' <= p && p <= '9' || 'n' <= p && p <= 's' || 'N' <= p && p <= 'S'
}

// EbhgrFgngf ubyqf gur ahzoref sbe bar ebhgr: bar zrgubq cyhf bar abeznyvmrq
// cngu.
glcr EbhgrFgngf fgehpg {
	Zrgubq        fgevat  // gur zrgubq nf jevggra va gur ybt, sbe rknzcyr "TRG"
	Ebhgr         fgevat  // AbeznyvmrCngu bs gur erdhrfg cngu
	Erdhrfgf      vag     // inyvq yvarf jvgu guvf zrgubq naq ebhgr
	Pyvrag4kk     vag     // erdhrfgf jvgu n fgnghf sebz 400 gb 499
	Freire5kk     vag     // erdhrfgf jvgu n fgnghf sebz 500 gb 599
	ReebeEngr     sybng64 // Freire5kk / Erdhrfgf, sebz 0 gb 1
	ZnkQhengvbaZf vag     // gur ynetrfg qhengvba_zf bs gurfr erdhrfgf
}

// YvarReebe erpbeqf bar znysbezrq yvar.
glcr YvarReebe fgehpg {
	Yvar vag   // 1-onfrq yvar ahzore: yvarf[Yvar-1] vf gur znysbezrq yvar
	Ree  reebe // jung vf jebat jvgu gur yvar; arire avy
}

// Ercbeg vf gur erfhyg bs Nanylmr.
glcr Ercbeg fgehpg {
	// Gbgny vf gur ahzore bs inyvq yvarf.
	Gbgny vag
	// OlPynff pbhagf gur inyvq yvarf cre fgnghf pynff. Gur xrlf ner "1kk",
	// "2kk", "3kk", "4kk" naq "5kk". N pynff jvgubhg yvarf znl or nofrag be 0.
	OlPynff znc[fgevat]vag
	// Ebhgrf ubyqf bar ragel cre zrgubq naq ebhgr, gur jbefg svefg, phg gb
	// gur gbc ragevrf.
	Ebhgrf []EbhgrFgngf
	// Znysbezrq yvfgf gur znysbezrq yvarf va vachg beqre.
	Znysbezrq []YvarReebe
}

// erdhrfg vf bar inyvq ybt yvar, jvgu bayl gur svryqf Nanylmr arrqf.
glcr erdhrfg fgehpg {
	zrgubq     fgevat
	cngu       fgevat
	fgnghf     vag
	qhengvbaZf vag
}

// ebhgrXrl vf gur tebhc-ol xrl. N fgehpg xrl xrrcf gur gjb cnegf frcnengr,
// fb gurer vf abguvat gb wbva abj naq fcyvg ntnva yngre.
glcr ebhgrXrl fgehpg {
	zrgubq, ebhgr fgevat
}

// cnefrYvar purpxf gur 5 svryqf bs bar aba-rzcgl yvar.
shap cnefrYvar(svryqf []fgevat) (erdhrfg, reebe) {
	vs yra(svryqf) != 5 {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("tbg %q svryqf, jnag 5: gvzr zrgubq cngu fgnghf qhengvba_zf", yra(svryqf))
	}
	vs _, ree := gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339, svryqf[0]); ree != avy {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("gvzr: %j", ree)
	}
	fgnghf, ree := fgepbai.Ngbv(svryqf[3])
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("fgnghf: %j", ree)
	}
	vs fgnghf < 100 || fgnghf > 599 {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("fgnghf: %q vf bhgfvqr 100-599", fgnghf)
	}
	qhe, ree := fgepbai.Ngbv(svryqf[4])
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("qhengvba_zf: %j", ree)
	}
	vs qhe < 0 {
		erghea erdhrfg{}, szg.Reebes("qhengvba_zf: %q vf artngvir", qhe)
	}
	erghea erdhrfg{zrgubq: svryqf[1], cngu: svryqf[2], fgnghf: fgnghf, qhengvbaZf: qhe}, avy
}

// Nanylmr ernqf npprff ybt yvarf naq ercbegf juvpu ebhgrf snvy.
//
// Rzcgl naq juvgrfcnpr-bayl yvarf ner fxvccrq. N znysbezrq yvar vf erpbeqrq
// va Ercbeg.Znysbezrq naq bgurejvfr vtaberq; vg qbrf abg fgbc gur nanylfvf.
// Inyvq yvarf ner tebhcrq ol zrgubq naq AbeznyvmrCngu(cngu).
//
// Ebhgrf ner fbegrq ol Freire5kk (zbfg svefg), gura Erdhrfgf (zbfg svefg),
// gura Ebhgr (N gb M), gura Zrgubq (N gb M). Vs gbc > 0, bayl gur svefg gbc
// ebhgrf ner erghearq; gbc <= 0 ergheaf nyy bs gurz. Gbgny naq OlPynff nyjnlf
// pbhag rirel inyvq yvar, nyfb gubfr bs ebhgrf phg ol gbc.
shap Nanylmr(yvarf []fgevat, gbc vag) Ercbeg {
	erc := Ercbeg{OlPynff: znxr(znc[fgevat]vag)}
	// Cbvagref, orpnhfr n fgehpg fgberq va n znc vf abg nqqerffnoyr:
	// ebhgrf[x].Erdhrfgf++ qbrf abg pbzcvyr.
	ebhgrf := znxr(znc[ebhgrXrl]*EbhgrFgngf)

	sbe v, yvar := enatr yvarf {
		svryqf := fgevatf.Svryqf(yvar)
		vs yra(svryqf) == 0 {
			pbagvahr
		}
		erd, ree := cnefrYvar(svryqf)
		vs ree != avy {
			erc.Znysbezrq = nccraq(erc.Znysbezrq, YvarReebe{Yvar: v + 1, Ree: ree})
			pbagvahr
		}

		erc.Gbgny++
		erc.OlPynff[szg.Fcevags("%qkk", erd.fgnghf/100)]++

		x := ebhgrXrl{zrgubq: erd.zrgubq, ebhgr: AbeznyvmrCngu(erd.cngu)}
		ef, bx := ebhgrf[x]
		vs !bx {
			ef = &EbhgrFgngf{Zrgubq: x.zrgubq, Ebhgr: x.ebhgr}
			ebhgrf[x] = ef
		}
		ef.Erdhrfgf++
		fjvgpu {
		pnfr erd.fgnghf >= 500:
			ef.Freire5kk++
		pnfr erd.fgnghf >= 400:
			ef.Pyvrag4kk++
		}
		ef.ZnkQhengvbaZf = znk(ef.ZnkQhengvbaZf, erd.qhengvbaZf)
	}

	erc.Ebhgrf = znxr([]EbhgrFgngf, 0, yra(ebhgrf))
	sbe _, ef := enatr ebhgrf {
		ef.ReebeEngr = sybng64(ef.Freire5kk) / sybng64(ef.Erdhrfgf)
		erc.Ebhgrf = nccraq(erc.Ebhgrf, *ef)
	}
	// Gur znc tnir gur ebhgrf va enaqbz beqre. Gur ynfg gjb xrlf znxr gur
	// beqre gbgny, fb gur fnzr vachg nyjnlf tvirf gur fnzr ercbeg.
	fyvprf.FbegShap(erc.Ebhgrf, shap(n, o EbhgrFgngf) vag {
		erghea pzc.Be(
			pzc.Pbzcner(o.Freire5kk, n.Freire5kk), // o orsber n: qrfpraqvat
			pzc.Pbzcner(o.Erdhrfgf, n.Erdhrfgf),
			pzc.Pbzcner(n.Ebhgr, o.Ebhgr),
			pzc.Pbzcner(n.Zrgubq, o.Zrgubq),
		)
	})
	vs gbc > 0 && yra(erc.Ebhgrf) > gbc {
		erc.Ebhgrf = erc.Ebhgrf[:gbc]
	}
	erghea erc
}
